# Design / context / verification documents do NOT live in this repository.
# They are maintained in the separate notes repo:
#     git@github.com:vidsinghal/llm-notes.git   ->  gibbon-soa-layout/
# The former /context-docs/ folder was moved there and deleted from this tree.
# It was always .gitignore'd, so nothing was ever committed here and no history
# rewrite was involved.  This rule stays so a stray local copy is never
# committed by accident.
/context-docs/

